{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "85b4f93002b1f370dd7cd7675c8606f68df0211edc7d6d22b2d62ae677765baa", "ja": "アイディアを形に！", "zh": "将创意化为实体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bea057391b522c6d6b6fc07917dad7839709d10d256f9e5b6a72a8eaee98eebd", "ja": "翼の発案で、朝からミーティングのため\n集合した貴音たち。翼お手製のアイディア\nシートを囲みながら、皆は次の公演について\n話し合う。プロデューサーの助言も生かし、\n徐々に公演の方向性が定まってきた。", "zh": "在翼的提议下，贵音等人从早上开始就集合开会。大家围着翼亲手制作的创意表，一起讨论接下来的公演。在采纳制作人的建议后，公演的方向也逐渐确定了下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "ae9cc88729e20975045da0a38347a678cfaafa09983761b6bffbc3e8896fb434", "ja": "ツアーミーティング・2日目……", "zh": "巡演会议·第2天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "34d9ea02f4c5891aa2cde50a61ac9187aab8ef2133cd1adeec66ee4072ee8b41", "ja": "あっ。恵美さん、まつりさん、貴音さん！\nこっちですよ～。", "zh": "啊，惠美姐、茉莉姐、贵音姐！\n这边哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "4b972fcd3445ec48f546a12ec5175e16086360aa526ed757958e45bd0249da51", "ja": "あ、いたいた翼。お疲れ～。\nどしたの？　1時間前集合って。", "zh": "啊，找到了，翼。辛苦啦～\n怎么了？怎么会说要提前1小时集合？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "8feaa07f8f3482fcbd4f6493e994e911f756405f7ca62d1a6b8ed90fb1e81703", "ja": "姫も、気になっていたのです。\n翼ちゃん、何か理由があるのです？", "zh": "公主也很在意呢。\n翼，是有什么原因吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5a3936a1de4cf3f881f9ae9da28b3d920b9c7858cfcdef719a98f38e920f5b41", "ja": "えへへ、そうなんです！　実は、みんなに\n見てもらいたいものがあって……じゃーん！", "zh": "嘿嘿，没错！其实呢，有样东西想给大家看看……锵锵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "35f1367bf04107a4dd393ae76642c8250774b74d384216d086c37c5a397ed000", "ja": "これって……こないだのミーティングで、\nアタシたちがしゃべってたこと？", "zh": "这个是……前几天开会时，\n我们聊到的事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b7032d8c78fa26f3c4dfbe3f22e4d33ac77da53bdeb56cd6cfbed7be611c784b", "ja": "はい！　ツアーについて、みんなから出た\nアイディアを、紙に書いてきました！", "zh": "是的！这是关于巡演的，我把大家提出的想法都写在纸上带来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f2f9156cefa51abfe95611088d00d573cca51b1528cc72b0814c0ae9de5ce743", "ja": "いっぱいあったから、すごく\n大きな紙になっちゃいましたけど。", "zh": "因为有好多好多，结果变成了\n好大的一张纸呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "6a8cf69f1a36885d528e9184845da1030a368d165420bec39c07cc0767a8fe98", "ja": "なるほど……。演出、楽曲、物販と、\n分けて書いてあるのですね。", "zh": "原来如此……演出、歌曲和商品销售，都是分开写的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6e0b9e0f72d960e967d8cbeb0f43d2648e0dfe50051d8c195895c3a25e4d007b", "ja": "なんかこうすると、こっちは絶対無理だなーとか。\nこれならできそうとか、考えがまとまるって聞いて♪", "zh": "听说像这样做的话，就能整理思路，比如这个肯定做不到啦，那个好像又能做到之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "02f74b0e54e3f40335807195560ecc644eeeea5b06ae74def384cb39db105b74", "ja": "そういう理由でしたか。翼の言うとおり、こうして\n考えを可視化するのは、非常に意義があると思います。", "zh": "原来是这样的理由啊。正如翼所说，我觉得像这样将想法可视化，是非常有意义的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "692882c2b66f46c3cea24838c5d793f1c34cc0de96dca4878ddf1fa80b810e49", "ja": "うんうん。めちゃわかりやすいよ、これ！\nやるじゃん、翼♪", "zh": "嗯嗯。这个真的特别直观！\n干得不错嘛，翼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9c4f628099d5f5ece1e358c7449f1451d858063f87abcfa6a192756ee682a808", "ja": "ホントですか！？\nありがとうございま～す！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n谢谢你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "190b7a6fedcde9465ff0bc2d0f536147ee03f9cbbd0840ae0e403c2237a116ca", "ja": "それでは、翼ちゃんお手製のアイディアシートを\n使って、一足先にミーティングを始めるのです！", "zh": "那么，就用翼亲手制作的创意表，提前开始会议吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "d61a1fd58dcfc5d2a7a2455288170eac8926a80522d99ab7a19999747d440fc0", "ja": "進行も、翼ちゃんにおまかせなのです。\nどれから話し合うのです？", "zh": "接下来的流程也交给翼了。要先讨论哪一项呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2fb2c319aad73f380f058a0da03a72fb3ffb1b3303f72ac8c26040a585e57066", "ja": "今回のツアーのコンセプトって、たしか『劇場の良さを\n全国に届ける』ですよね？　まずはそこからかな～。", "zh": "这次巡演的主题，我记得是“把剧场的精彩传递到全国各地”，对吧？那就先从这个开始吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "e14bdc88e672d8a684d411e86e5df59e5da8835317f8f25782e0ee85d0c1d590", "ja": "そうだよね。でもそれって、\n具体的にどうやればいいのかな～？", "zh": "对啊。不过具体来说，\n到底该怎么做才好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "121677418f1f3ac5e02b02a4e36026cb4479c0ff61b4b7586bd7ca881226b889", "ja": "そうですね……。その土地の方々にとっても、\n何か、特別な体験になればと思うのですが……。", "zh": "是啊……我希望对当地人来说，也能成为某种特别的体验……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "3153474c30968c2ff05d2f688e8a1de56f242eabf83cfeaf23eb472b149493cf", "ja": "体験かぁ。体験……ライブを観るだけじゃなく、\nなんか、参加してる感じとかほしいよね。", "zh": "体验啊。体验……不只是观看演出，\n还想要那种参与其中的感觉，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "792cad7aeafbbe556b3fd805ac97a6667008a34875de877ce76a4bd968d43c97", "ja": "あっ！　なら、地元の人たちとコラボして、\nステージに上がってもらっちゃうとか！？", "zh": "啊！那就和当地的人们合作，让他们也登上舞台怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "16adcbd7877140ed4470f6d57c6ea401aaea7113f56e2b1614d3f3e27db5ef70", "ja": "地元の人たちとわたしたち、みんなでステージに\n立つのって、なんか面白くないですか？", "zh": "当地的人们和我们大家一起站在舞台上，\n感觉不是很有趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "58aa1a3039fde456d533e6a8782daea36fd9603c1589021f7190a92d3fb7acd4", "ja": "翼、すごいこと考えるね？　けど、たしかに\n特別な体験にはなるかも……？", "zh": "翼，你真能想出这种点子呢？不过，确实可能会成为一次特别的体验……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "4546643d31bfd4ea09e6f6b555395c24cfa9476005028b238a2999fe68f5f156", "ja": "翼ちゃん……わんだほーなのです～！\nアイドルに憧れる、小さい子たちの夢が叶う……。", "zh": "翼……真是太棒了——！\n憧憬着偶像的小孩子们的梦想，就要实现了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "17acacf3a42ccfca161bd89ecbbea0c667c5cf874e6892bf6183b5ce4196e38d", "ja": "そう考えると、とっても素敵なアイディアだと\n姫は思うのですよ。", "zh": "这样想来，姬觉得这是个非常棒的主意哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8c659133c82abb9df66ab815e8767b1938acf080b20bd90d88fd620e89deecdc", "ja": "まつりさん……えへっ。", "zh": "真理酱……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "43e5d281a74fd18c8dfe9409b0e63c0d4acda24f8f0ebb70c85747ad9670e1c6", "ja": "しかし、希望者が皆、ステージに立つのは\n難しいかと……数に限りが出てしまいますね。", "zh": "不过，要让所有报名的人都站上舞台，恐怕有些困难……毕竟名额有限。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "695b37df189e25c321e3996d9aec1b99ceddb32f8eb62f6cc6446472c4068ce4", "ja": "そっか～……。ステージに、そんなにたくさんの人は\n立てないですもんね。いい案だと思ったんだけどな～。", "zh": "这样啊～……毕竟舞台上也站不了那么多人嘛。我还觉得这是个不错的主意呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "2a6ece2cb4758ae6dc03a39d5204aa6f9e3e00c3f03bf931a55e9aec23de5934", "ja": "（なんだか、レストスペースの方が騒がしいな。\nこの声は……翼達か）", "zh": "（总觉得休息区那边比平时热闹啊。\n这个声音是……翼她们吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "236bc725cc08a85a765983176453675ad5f9e5a5e243388c59bed7fb8af40a6b", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！　ずいぶん早いんだな？\nミーティングの時間まで、まだあるけど……。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！来得真早啊？\n离开会还有一段时间呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2995e6e49ac58d0d4387049409f4d5f06b20691d45c3e6ff09f83916bf931cf1", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　実はミーティング\nの前に、みんなでアイディア出しをしてたんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！其实我们在会议前，大家一起集思广益来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "145364888e883c7b8ff8e7b1aa95e8cd9b73468734befcc6fdf47d5c1c03e808", "ja": "翼ちゃんが、この前のミーティングをまとめた\nアイディアシートを作ってきてくれたのですよ。", "zh": "翼把之前那次会议总结好的想法，整理成了一份想法表带来了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "938b4318ff83c6d7b270efef371dec66af7a87ca85927162c042f42af490faf7", "ja": "おおっ、よくまとまってるじゃないか。\nありがとう、翼！　助かるよ。", "zh": "哦，整理得相当不错嘛。\n谢谢你，翼！帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "03d9a9aadb65537b93b9e77617580ed8be29d48bbd015a1ec01e0fbeb1a79fcb", "ja": "えへへっ、やった！\n{$P$}さんにも褒められちゃった♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了！\n还被{$P$}先生夸奖了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1034_008tak", "source_sha256": "a883fed848d2e536b7dd72a5a36957849c9dec37c3e63a26a443be1c4717fab6", "ja": "翼……先ほどの話、{$P$}にも\n相談してみてはいかがですか？", "zh": "翼……刚才说的那件事，要不要也去和{$P$}商量一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6a4b75f5511ee2ff438b58b27d2b476cc1c97523eb46ddd95ddc2ea71f0c140b", "ja": "ん？　さっきの話って？", "zh": "嗯？刚才说的什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "56ed363bcd308c9e6be1f3fed75830d7f51a3ef4baffc2e998e2548fbdd5d455", "ja": "あ、えっと。せっかく違う場所だから、なんか特別な\n楽しさがあってもいいんじゃないかなって話で……。", "zh": "啊，那个……我是在说，难得来到不同的地方，要是能体验到一些特别的乐趣，不是也挺好的吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "19628d37b63c0a29f380d7cece5f0db63753566fa32d4696584533952512d6c0", "ja": "それで、ツアー先の地元の人達と、コラボっていうか。\n一緒にステージに立てないかな？って。", "zh": "所以，我在想，要不要和巡演当地的人们合作，或者说……一起站上舞台？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "55f8796b16cd85e5777af0ef9a74af19fcaf06e60add743b34f529e558f53649", "ja": "なるほど……試みとしては面白いな。\n今までにない、新しい公演が作れそうだ。", "zh": "原来如此……作为一种尝试，确实很有意思。\n感觉能打造出前所未有的新公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "5088ef7d1e3abd380d48aac1a842688b58871c97fef321818c91c73361f860d1", "ja": "となると、楽曲はみんなが知ってる曲がいいだろうな。\nここはやっぱり、定番の全体曲か……。", "zh": "这样的话，歌曲最好选大家都知道的吧。\n果然还是经典的全员曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2ffc78fb474f539123b3fbd3082fdba02177d181f7052c35dc4a8dc1e3bf12d8", "ja": "はい！　わたし、『Brand New \nTheater!』がいいと思います！", "zh": "好的！我觉得《Brand New Theater!》很合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1041_021mat", "source_sha256": "3fb4113ed8f2607e19341da96d28d933226dace078983f55e5415e5e0ca9fea0", "ja": "劇場の良さを届けるのに、ピッタリな曲なのです。\nきっと、みんなで楽しく歌えるのです♪", "zh": "这首歌非常适合展现剧场的魅力。\n大家一定能一起开心地唱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1042_020meg", "source_sha256": "94a1e24d71f45975f3aba749794fd4c0f4556148b43b4115a264437d0065f0e9", "ja": "じゃあ、曲は決まりとして……ステージのほうは\nどうする？　流石に、希望者全員は厳しいよね～。", "zh": "那么，歌曲就定下来了……至于舞台这边，要怎么办？让所有报名的人都上台，果然还是有点困难吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1043_p", "source_sha256": "ce6099155dbc0aad4e0b25658089fa4072b6d41ed00d516c2e5715800a843074", "ja": "そうだな……客席にもカメラを入れて、\nモニターに映像を映してみようか。", "zh": "是啊……要不要也在观众席架上摄像机，把画面放到显示器上？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "fe19d52d3a28e5f88a7fe6c1de9d6a8aae573b4a7042170566f91b323add7184", "ja": "画面に歌詞も出して、その場にいる人達全員に、気軽に\n参加してもらえる雰囲気を出してみたらどうだろう？", "zh": "再在屏幕上显示歌词，营造出让现场所有人都能轻松参与的氛围，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1045_020meg", "source_sha256": "b378a284bc041ca3d520fd68d4f5b0605df1e12d7413f78489e7748cd66fba51", "ja": "そっか！　そしたらステージの広さとか関係ないし、\nみんな楽しくやれるかも！", "zh": "原来如此！这样就不用在意舞台大小了，说不定大家都能开心地参与进来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1046_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a58d1d2a2a820edbb210c9a2724ea2d9214c521d6920febc56d0969ab5270479", "ja": "わぁ、さすが{$P$}さん！\n頭いい～♪", "zh": "哇，真不愧是{$P$}先生！\n好聪明～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1047_p", "source_sha256": "98720f668261482a59ec37c0c8fa76029bea38875cbc38e19a671e50f12af687", "ja": "とはいえ、思った通りにできるかはわからないけど。\nせっかくだから、その方向で話を進めてみよう。", "zh": "话虽如此，能不能按预想的那样完成，我也不确定。\n难得有这个机会，就先按这个方向推进吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_02_1048_p", "source_sha256": "d5b8a0601bb6c816935a0f3208060e2c38c2fbd1428c82960e246f9c167fa506", "ja": "（ツアー初手という事もあってか、思った以上にみんな\n意欲的だ。この調子なら、上手くいきそうだ！）", "zh": "（也许是因为这是巡演的第一步，大家比想象中还要积极。照这个势头下去，应该能顺利进行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
